=== layout: one-panel

# Key takeaways

@body

- Start with the parental genotype and examine one pair of genes at a time.
- Cover the third gene while classifying parental and non-parental combinations.
- Sum non-parental progeny, divide by total progeny, and multiply by 100% for map distance.
- Use pairwise distances to determine gene order.

